# Data — the database and generated audio are not source. The exception is
# history.jsonl: the event log is the one thing that cannot be regenerated, and as an
# append-only text file it versions cleanly (see packages/schema/src/history.ts).
!data/history.jsonl
data/certs/
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
pipeline/out/

